1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,150
One hundred and eight cards. Four players. Two partnerships.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,822
Sheng Ji. Two decks. One level at a time.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,950
Declare with a level card. A pair is stronger. A pair of jokers calls no-trump.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,574
The declarer takes the bottom, buries eight, and leads.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:29,802
Follow the led group. Pair with pair, tractor with tractor, or ruff with trump.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:37,590
Take 5, 10 and K. Eighty points upgrades one level; a shutout jumps three.

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,950
Four computer levels, a private hot-seat, and a LAN table.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,400
Offline. No account. No ads.
